+
+After this foundation is reviewed and the user decides to merge it into
+`main`, create `feature/bch-s2-formal-channel-comparison` from the updated
+`main` only. That future branch will define the approved 200/300-bit framing
+policies and execute the full four-scheme comparison across AWGN, fixed
+multipath, residual CFO, short blockage, burst error, and required
+interleaving. It must not be created from the archive branch.
